meta {
  name: Get Total Activity Per Month
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/history/total_activity_per_month/:year
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  year: 2024
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Total Activity Per Month

  This request is used to get total activity per month by given `year`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type    | Required | Description        | Example |
  |------|---------|----------|----------------------|---------|
  | year | integer | yes      | Activity created year | 2024  |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Stats fetched successfully.** Ordered in ascending order by `context` (month order format)
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": [
      { "context": "Jan", "total": 3 }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}